** ==============================================================================
** ABAQUS/STANDARD MATERIAL LIBRARY INCLUDE DECK: AUTOMOTIVE POWERTRAIN ASSEMBLY
** ==============================================================================
** Project:      01. Helical Crown Gear & Differential Carrier Assembly
** Application:  Welded Crown Gear to Carrier Locobox Joint with 30° Weld Defect
** Components:
**   1. Crown Gear Ring  : 20MC5 (AFNOR NF A 35-551 / DIN EN 10084 20MnCr5 / 1.7147)
**   2. Carrier Inner Disk: GJS600-10 (EN 1563 / EN-GJS-600-10 / 5.3110 SSF Ductile Iron)
** Units System: SI Metric (mm, tonne, s, N, MPa = N/mm2, mJ)
** Author:       Victor Maia (vhfm08@gmail.com)
** ==============================================================================
**
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
** 1. MATERIAL 1: 20MC5 CASE-HARDENING STEEL (CROWN GEAR)
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
** Metallurgy & State:
**   - Standard: AFNOR NF A 35-551 / DIN EN 10084 (20MnCr5 / W.Nr. 1.7147)
**   - Chemical composition: 0.17-0.22% C, 1.10-1.40% Mn, 1.00-1.30% Cr, 0.15-0.40% Si
**   - Condition: Carburized (920°C), direct oil quenched (860°C), tempered at 180°C
**   - Core bulk properties (cross-section 16-40 mm, rim width b = 30 mm):
**       * Young's modulus E = 210,000 MPa, Poisson's ratio nu = 0.30
**       * Density rho = 7.85e-9 tonne/mm^3 (7850 kg/m^3)
**       * Core yield strength Rp0.2 = 750.0 MPa (calibrated from Renault / Husson et al.)
**       * Core tensile strength Rm = 1050.0 MPa, elongation A5 = 10%
**       * Thermal expansion alpha = 1.15e-5 K^-1
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL_20MC5
*DENSITY
 7.85E-09
*ELASTIC, TYPE=ISOTROPIC
 210000.0, 0.30
*EXPANSION, ZERO=20.0
 1.15E-05
*PLASTIC, HARDENING=ISOTROPIC
** True Yield Stress [MPa], Plastic Strain [-]
 750.0, 0.0000
 880.0, 0.0100
 980.0, 0.0300
 1050.0, 0.0600
 1120.0, 0.1000
**
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
** 2. MATERIAL 2: GJS600_10 SOLID-SOLUTION FERRITIC DUCTILE IRON (CARRIER DISK)
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
** Metallurgy & State:
**   - Standard: EN 1563:2018 / EN-GJS-600-10 (Material Number: 5.3110 / EN-JS1060)
**   - Metallurgy: Solid-Solution Strengthened Ferritic (SSF) Nodular Cast Iron (Si ~ 3.8-4.2%)
**   - Key distinction: Unlike conventional pearlitic GJS-600-3 (elongation only 3%),
**     the SSF ferritic matrix delivers BOTH high strength (Rm >= 600 MPa, Rp0.2 >= 470 MPa)
**     AND exceptional ductility (A5 >= 10%), preventing brittle fracture at weld notches.
**   - Differential carrier bulk properties (wall thickness t <= 30 mm):
**       * Young's modulus E = 170,000 MPa, Poisson's ratio nu = 0.275
**       * Density rho = 7.10e-9 tonne/mm^3 (7100 kg/m^3)
**       * Proof strength Rp0.2 = 470.0 MPa (EN 1563 normative minimum)
**       * Tensile strength Rm = 600.0 MPa, minimum elongation A5 = 10%
**       * Thermal expansion alpha = 1.25e-5 K^-1
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*MATERIAL, NAME=GJS600_10
*DENSITY
 7.10E-09
*ELASTIC, TYPE=ISOTROPIC
 170000.0, 0.275
*EXPANSION, ZERO=20.0
 1.25E-05
*PLASTIC, HARDENING=ISOTROPIC
** True Yield Stress [MPa], Plastic Strain [-]
 470.0, 0.0000
 520.0, 0.0100
 565.0, 0.0300
 600.0, 0.0600
 625.0, 0.1000
